Installation Instructions
=========================

By tamago.rebirh@gmail.com


0) autoconf (maybe prompted to run autoupdate !)

1) ./configure --datadir=/usr/local/share

   Under Debian GNU/Linux default site-lisp is stored in /usr/local/share/emacs/site-lisp/egg.
   Note: datadir is the prefix before "emacs/site-lisp/egg"
   Thus I pass --datadir=/usr/local/share

2) make
3) make install (as root)

   Curret Makefile no longer copies .elc files.

Please see
https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Startup-Summary.html

Or if you do not want to edit your system files,
you can add to ~/.emacs as follows:

(add-to-list 'load-path "/usr/local/share/emacs/site-lisp/egg")

;;; Note that the following may cause cyclic loading. In that case, don't load the following file.
;;; (load-file "/usr/local/share/emacs/site-lisp/egg/leim-list.el")
